Hi Tom,

Thanks for taking a look at the KIP!

1. I've clarified that point. The tag names automatically added are
now mentioned in the Javadoc. In case user-provided tags collide, the
metricName() method will throw IllegalArgumentException

2. That's a nice suggestion! I've made that change.

3. You're right the interface does not need to be Closeable. I've
removed it so users can't call it by mistake.

Thanks,
Mickael

