ere "refactors," "optimizations", "tests", etc.) to KAFKA-17241 to hopef=
ully clear up the confusion a bit. I think a lot of these would be good =
newbie JIRAs (although probably not the "refactor" ones :)

As I said, we'll shoot for getting the remaining feature tasks for KIP-8=
53 done in a few days. Probably by Monday.

best,
Colin


