>>> >>> > > > > > > Specificity is based on the Levenshtein distance betwee=
n
>>> the
>>> >>> > > pattern
>>> >>> > > > and
>>> >>> > > > > > > the text being evaluated. The lower the distance the mo=
re
>>> >>> specific
>>> >>> > > > the
