Matthias J. Sax created KAFKA-17253:
---------------------------------------

             Summary: Remove leaking getter methods in Joined helper class
                 Key: KAFKA-17253
                 URL: https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-17253
             Project: Kafka
          Issue Type: Improvement
          Components: streams
            Reporter: Matthias J. Sax


The helper class `Joined` has three getter methods `keySerde()`, `valueSerde()` and `otherValueSerde()` which don't belong to this class.

We should deprecate them for future removal and move them to `JoinedInternal` where they belong.



