fka.common.metrics.Metrics -- Metrics scheduler closed
00:11:29.967 [kafka-admin-client-thread | adminclient-1] INFO org.apache.ka=
fka.common.metrics.Metrics -- Closing reporter org.apache.kafka.common.metr=
ics.JmxReporter
00:11:29.967 [kafka-admin-client-thread | adminclient-1] INFO org.apache.ka=
