log4j.appender.stderr.Target=3DSystem.err

# for connect-plugin-path
log4j.logger.org.reflections=3DERROR{code}
This is a very bizarre bug since nothing changed from our end other than ei=
ther upgrading to 3.7.1. We also tried upgrading to 3.8.0 to see if it goes=
 away but it doesn't. What makes this worse is that the same issue also hap=
pens with Kafka server. Kafka server starting from 3.7.1 only seems to add =
