CONTRIBUTING doc says to nag :)
Please check out my PR that adds server side ability to intercept =
incoming messages. My org needs to be able to apply lineage and certain =
other tiny transforms to all the messages on the server side, and this =
feature would allow us to adopt Kafka.=20
The alternatives of using a client side solution(like streams) or =
creating a proxy in front of Kafka is a very heavy lift and we would =
prefer to avoid it.=20
If there are other ways to intercept an incoming message and manipulate =
it, please point me in the right direction.=20
Thanks!
Max


