g features for a given metadata version. Using the command with no =C2=A0{{=
--release-version}}=C2=A0 argument will return the mapping for the latest s=
table metadata version.
 * Add=C2=A0{{feature-dependencies}}=C2=A0command to look up dependencies f=
or a given feature version supplied by=C2=A0{{--feature}}=C2=A0flag. If the=
 feature is not known or the version not yet defined, throw an error.=C2=A0



