Alyssa Huang created KAFKA-17282:
------------------------------------

             Summary: pollUnattachedAsObserver should not consider electionTimeoutMs
                 Key: KAFKA-17282
                 URL: https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-17282
             Project: Kafka
          Issue Type: Bug
            Reporter: Alyssa Huang


After electionTimeout expiration unattached observers will send fetch requests every {{QUORUM_REQUEST_TIMEOUT_MS_CONFIG}} (which can be longer than we want), and poll the message queue for 0 seconds (meaning we won't be able to accept any inbound messages). Our tests don't replicate this behavior currently due to how we've mocked the message queue.



--
