------------------------------------
    Fix Version/s: 4.0.0
       Resolution: Fixed

> Fix ConcurrentModificationException caused by NioEchoServer.closeNewChannels
> ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
>
>                 Key: KAFKA-17269
>                 URL: https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-17269
>             Project: Kafka
>          Issue Type: Test
>            Reporter: Chia-Ping Tsai
>            Assignee: bboyleonp
>            Priority: Minor
>             Fix For: 4.0.0
>
>
> see CI: https://ci-builds.apache.org/blue/organizations/jenkins/Kafka%2Fkafka-pr/detail/PR-16795/1/tests
> `newChannels` is a SYNC ArrayList, however, the helper method does not protect "iteration". Hence, we should add `synchronized (newChannels)` for it.



