Andrew Schofield resolved KAFKA-17217.
--------------------------------------
    Resolution: Fixed

> Clients : Optimise batching of requests per node in ShareConsumeRequestMa=
nager
> -------------------------------------------------------------------------=
-----
>
>                 Key: KAFKA-17217
>                 URL: https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-17217
>             Project: Kafka
>          Issue Type: Sub-task
>            Reporter: Shivsundar R
>            Assignee: Shivsundar R
>            Priority: Major
>
> In ShareConsumeRequestManager, currently every time we perform a commitSy=
nc or commitAsync, we create one ShareAcknowledge RPC for the same. Here, w=
e can optimise the number of RPC calls by batching the acknowledgements bef=
ore the next poll is invoked per node.=C2=A0
> This will ensure that between 2 calls, the acknowledgements are accumulat=
ed in one request per node and then sent during poll, resulting in lesser R=
PC calls.



--
