    Resolution: Cannot Reproduce

This seems to have been fixed as it is no longer seen after three test runs of the entire system test suite.

> New consumer system tests pass for subset of tests, but fail if running all tests
> ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------
>
>                 Key: KAFKA-17183
