Abhijeet Kumar created KAFKA-17313:
--------------------------------------

             Summary: Fix object metric name for Tiered Storage quotas
                 Key: KAFKA-17313
                 URL: https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-17313
             Project: Kafka
          Issue Type: Task
            Reporter: Abhijeet Kumar


Currently, the metric object name for tiered storage quotas metrics is set =
to `kafka.server:type=3DRemoteLogManager`, but it should instead be `kafka.=
log.remote:type=3DRemoteLogManager`.

This is because of a limitation where when creating a SensorAccess, it need=
s org.apache.kafka.common.metrics.Metrics, but with this the prefix becomes=
 kafka.server and cannot be changed. We instead need to use KafkaMetricsGro=
up but there is no way to create SensorAccess with it.

