Dongnuo Lyu created KAFKA-17317:
-----------------------------------

             Summary: Validate and maybe trigger downgrade after static member replacement
                 Key: KAFKA-17317
                 URL: https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-17317
             Project: Kafka
          Issue Type: Sub-task
            Reporter: Dongnuo Lyu
            Assignee: Dongnuo Lyu


When a static member replaces the member with the same instance id, if the replaced one uses old protocol and the replacing one uses new protocol, currently the downgrade can't be triggered in such situation. We should validate the online downgrade after the replacement.



