hi TengYao

thanks for this KIP.=20

1) could you please describe the before/after behavior in the "Proposed Chang=
es" section? IIRC, current RPC allows HB having member id generated by client=
, right? If HB has no member ID, server will generate one and then return. Th=
e new behavior will enforce HB "must" have member ID.

2) could you please write the version number explicitly in the KIP

3) how new client code handle the old HB? Does it always generate member ID o=
n client-side even though that is not restricted?=20

Best,
Chia-Ping

