{{ConsumerConfig}} should be updated to include additional validation in{{{=
} postProcessParsedConfig(){}}}=E2=80=94when {{group.protocol}} is set to {=
{{}CONSUMER{}}}, the value for {{partition.assignment.strategy}} must be ei=
ther null or empty. Otherwise a {{ConfigException}} should be thrown.

This is somewhat of the inverse case of KAFKA-15773.



