Sushant Mahajan created KAFKA-17342:
---------------------------------------

             Summary: Move common coordinator code from group-coordinator into separate module coordinator-common
                 Key: KAFKA-17342
                 URL: https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-17342
             Project: Kafka
          Issue Type: Sub-task
            Reporter: Sushant Mahajan
