hi

Normally, this kind of issue needs a "JIRA" and a "KIP". That is a rule of
kafka community.

The jira is used to describe your idea briefly, display the fix version,
and other details. Also, we can keep tech discussion over there.

The KIP is used to discuss the public APIs or big changes.

Hence, please file jira for your PR first.

Best,
Chia-Ping

Maxim Fortun <max@maxf.net> =E6=96=BC 2024=E5=B9=B48=E6=9C=8815=E6=97=A5 =
