Hi TengYao Chi and Jiunn Yang,

Thank you for voting on the KIP!

For your information, your votes are not binding if you are not 
committers for the Apache Kafka project. Please see 
https://cwiki.apache.org/confluence/display/KAFKA/Bylaws#Bylaws-Voting

You can vote with "+1" or "+1 (non-binding)". The latter helps the 
author of the KIP to distinguish between binding and non-binding votes. 
However, an author should always verify each vote.

Even if your votes are not binding, they are still very useful and 
valuable for the community. Please keep voting on KIPs!

Best,
Bruno

