>
> AM3: The `registerMetricsForSubscription` method only subscribes metrics
> for telemetry reporting; it does not give them to the JMX reporter.  The
> application implementer is responsible for providing metrics to any other
> reporter.  For example, when starting an application, Kafka Streams
> separately exposes all its metrics to a JMX reporter.
