Chia-Ping Tsai created KAFKA-17415:
--------------------------------------

             Summary: Avoid overflow of expiried timestamp
                 Key: KAFKA-17415
                 URL: https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-17415
             Project: Kafka
          Issue Type: Bug
            Reporter: Chia-Ping Tsai
            Assignee: Chia-Ping Tsai


Both of zk and kraft modes do not handle the overflow, and hence setting a large max life time will cause a negative expired timestamp and negative max timestamp. That is unexpected behavior.

[0] https://github.com/apache/kafka/blob/0123bdcf06d2554ea62ba3a75af7c4b17eb4d23a/metadata/src/main/java/org/apache/kafka/controller/DelegationTokenControlManager.java#L191
