Claude Warren created KAFKA-17423:
-------------------------------------

             Summary: Replace StandardAuthorizer with Trie implementation
                 Key: KAFKA-17423
                 URL: https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-17423
             Project: Kafka
          Issue Type: Improvement
          Components: core
    Affects Versions: 3.8.0, 0.9.0.2
            Reporter: Claude Warren


KAFKA-17316 introduces extensible StandardAuthorizer.=C2=A0 This change is =
to provide a Trie based authorizer that extends the StandardAuthorizer.

Tests indicate that such an authroizer is 2 orders of magnitude faster than=
 the current authorizer.

=C2=A0
h2. Trie vs KRAFT Standard Search times
h3. Evaluation of Head wildcard

I=C2=A0 developed some quick tests using random words and creating literal =
ACLs by combining three words with hyphens.=C2=A0 Prefixed ACLs were create=
d by removing the last word from the literal acl.=C2=A0 Head wildcard ACLs =
were created by removing the first word from the literal ACLs and replacing=
 it with an asterisk "*".

All literal ACLs were searched for in each test.=C2=A0 =C2=A0Timing was rec=
orded in nano seconds and converted to seconds for this table.=C2=A0=C2=A0T=
he results here show that the Trie search beats the Standard search for bot=
h literal and prefix searches.=C2=A0 In addition the new head wildcard sear=
ch is approximately as fast as the current literal search.=C2=A0=C2=A0
