h3. JMS Test Suite

All tests were run using the standard JMS test suite from the Kafka test li=
brary.=C2=A0 All values are for runs comprising 50 ACLs with 100K Resources=
.=C2=A0 Each test was executed 15 times and the median score and error calc=
ulated.=C2=A0 The maximum memory consumption for each test is also presente=
d.

Both implementations pass all the Authorizer, and AuthorizerProperty tests.=
=C2=A0

Test were executed on a Thinkpad with Ryzen pro 7 running Ubuntu 22.04.4 LT=
S with a total of 28544904 Kb memory.=C2=A0 The test system was unable to r=
un the Standard tests for 200K resoources as it ran out of memory, though i=
t was able to do so for the Trie tests.=C2=A0

Tests do not include any head wildcard tests as they are not supported by S=
tandard implementation.
h4. Acls Iterator

This test retrieves an iterator over the collection of ACLs that is filtere=
d by an AclBindingFilter.=C2=A0 This is a measure of how fast the system ca=
n scan all the ACLs looking for specific data.=C2=A0 ACLs are not searched =
for by resource name.
