Andrew Schofield created KAFKA-17425:
----------------------------------------

             Summary: Improve coexistence of consumer groups and share groups
                 Key: KAFKA-17425
                 URL: https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-17425
             Project: Kafka
          Issue Type: Sub-task
            Reporter: Andrew Schofield
            Assignee: Andrew Schofield
             Fix For: 4.0.0


Investigate all of the situations in which consumer group and share group operations can be used on the wrong type of group and ensure that the result is good.

Currently, there is at least one ClassCastException in the group coordinator related to this, so this task will resolve that.



