Matthias J. Sax created KAFKA-17427:
---------------------------------------

             Summary: Fix leaking *_DOC variables in StreamsConfig
                 Key: KAFKA-17427
                 URL: https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-17427
             Project: Kafka
          Issue Type: Improvement
          Components: streams
            Reporter: Matthias J. Sax


StreamsConfigs has two variables per config, one for the config name and one for the doc description. The second one for the doc description should be private, but it's public for some cases.

We should deprecate the public ones to allow us making them private in a future release.



