Hi Chia-Ping,

Thanks for the review!

This is a good point to add provision to convey the timeout from client to
the server.
Updated the KIP to add a new 'TimeoutMs' field in the ListOffsetsRequest
and bumped
the version to 10. To retain the existing ListOffsets request behaviour:

1. AdminClient will supply the "default.api.timeout.ms" as timeout in the
ListOffsetsRequest and
2. Consumer will supply the "request.timeout.ms" as timeout in the
ListOffsetsRequest

PTAL.

--
Kamal

