Thanks, Luke. Both the static and dynamic options for configuring unclea=
n leader election now work in 3.9, thanks to your help.

Dima, if you have only a transient need to do an unclean leader election=
, using the kafka-leader-election.sh script is still the best way. It av=
oids the risk for forgetting to turn off unclean leader election afterwa=
rds, and it's faster. You should only set the configurations for unclean=
 leader election if you want to leave it on forever. (i.e. you genuinely=
 don't care about losing data, and just always want a leader.)

best,
Colin


