Hi all,

Code freeze has officially arrived for Apache Kafka 3.9! If you have add=
itional fixes to get into the branch at this point, please ping me first=
 (unless it's already marked as a blocker in JIRA).

I did a first pass on the list of open JIRAs for 3.9, and moved out any =
that were not blockers for 3.9. In a few cases, I asked a question about=
 whether the JIRA was a blocker or not.

If all goes according to plan, we should now have two more weeks of stab=
ilization before the release.

Thanks, everyone.

Colin


