has=20
>>>> access only to static members of the class.
>>>> 2. I found no precedent in Kafka for using configs in static=20
>>>> initializers. I did find precedents for props and envs.
>>>> 3. Static members are initialized during the class load time and do =
not=20
>>>> yet have access to instances of the configuration class.
>>>> 4. Kafka can be run in multiple ways and in multiple environments =
that=20
>>>> pass configuration differently from just files. Docker and K8s envs=20=

