             Summary: Raise minimum MetadataVersion for ZK migration to 3.6
                 Key: KAFKA-17457
                 URL: https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-17457
             Project: Kafka
          Issue Type: Task
          Components: controller, migration
            Reporter: David Arthur
             Fix For: 3.6.3, 3.7.2, 3.8.0


In the 3.6.0 release notes, we announced that ZK migrations were production=
 ready.

> The 3.6.0 release marked the first production ready release for the migra=
tion of Kafka clusters from a ZooKeeper metadata system to a KRaft metadata=
 system. Users wanting to perform this migration are advised to first upgra=
de to 3.6.2 or 3.7.1 to receive important bug fixes.

Part of the reasoning behind this announcement was that the migration was f=
eature complete at this point (migration transactions and migration of dele=
gation tokens were included in 3.6).=C2=A0

If users are on a software version of 3.6 or higher, we should not let them=
 perform the migration at an older MetadataVersion. Otherwise, the migratio=
n will be done without the use of metadata transactions, which is not safe.



